                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ef7bf34-714d-3abf-ac9c-cee3e38b7c65",
                        "entry_id": "f2c1b7f5-908e-336a-bbe6-222238d1432f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "comfort (contentment, ease)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4496b797-a500-4a86-9cd4-2682b43ac4b0",
                                "sense_id": "9ef7bf34-714d-3abf-ac9c-cee3e38b7c65",
                                "text": "Не тако́в комфо́рт: как ро́скошь есть безу́мие, уро́дливое и неесте́ственное уклоне́ние от ука́занных приро́дой и ра́зумом потре́бностей, так комфо́рт есть разу́мное, вы́работанное до стро́гости и то́нкости удовлетворе́ние э́тим потре́бностям.",
                                "translation": "Comfort is not like that; as luxury is the insane, depraved, and unnatural deviation from the natural limits of normal human needs, comfort is the sensible, carefully regulated supply for these needs.",
                                "english": "Comfort is not like that; as luxury is the insane, depraved, and unnatural deviation from the natural limits of normal human needs, comfort is the sensible, carefully regulated supply for these needs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
